=== Mega Clotty ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = a
 | name        = Mega Clotty
 | id          = 282
 | base hp     = 20
 | environment = {{floor|Cellar}}<br>{{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{floor|Womb}}{{floor|Utero}}{{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
