'''Mega Clotties''' slowly move around the room, occasionally hopping. When one hops, it will usually fire six blood shots around itself, but it can also alternatively leave a puddle of [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] near itself. Even more rarely, the hop may spawn a {{E|Clotty}} or a collapsed {{E|Globin}}. Upon death, it’ll split into two {{E|Clotty|text=Clotties}}. Even though the sprite shows three conjoined Clotties, it always creates two upon death, and will never spawn three.
