== Notes ==
* All monsters listed on this page deal one whole heart of contact damage except for Mega Clotty which deals half a heart of contact damage.

== Trivia ==
* MemBrain is a pun on the word membrane, which means a thin, flexible layer of body tissue.
* Mama Guts slightly resembles a digestive system.
* {{dlc+|a}} The Mega Clotty’s behavior coincidentally bears some resemblance to a fan idea of a boss called “[[fanideas:Bosses#Mega Clotty|Mega Clotty]],” as, besides its name, this 2012 idea mentions that its behavior would be jumping up to shoot out blood shots as well as spawning one Clotty. However, the Mega Clotty is implemented as an enemy, not a boss, and some of its conceptual behaviors on the ideas wiki were never implemented for the fact that it’s purely coincidental.{{dlc-}}

